      <h2 class="display-l" id="lanes-title">Every change gets a lane.</h2>
      <p class="body-l">
        Routine work merges on evidence alone. The judge takes the middle. Auth, payments, personal data and any
        change to tests, CI or policy go to a person. Writes outside scope stop at the barrier.
      </p>
      <p class="body muted">
        Rules set the floor, and a learned model can only move a change up a lane, never down.
      </p>
